  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gbenondjou Gari Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project will enable GBENONDJOU to improve and expand their cassava and peanut processing and storage capabilities. The project seeks to build the groups production capacity through training in improved production techniques and access to appropriate processing equipment and facilities to increase productivity, reduce the labor requirements, and improve safety and working conditions, as well as meet health and sanitation standards.</narrative>
  </description>
